			(property "Description" "Dedicated nano-Iq 2.5V LDO for the LSM6DSV16X analog rail (TPS7A0525 / LP5907-2.5 class, ~1uA Iq). Keeps charger switching noise and SIM7070G RF burst transients off the accelerometer supply. VDDIO of the IMU is NOT fed from here - it is tied to the module VDD_EXT 1.8V reference so the I/O levels match."
